	<string>Oatmeal names your meeting notes after the event in your calendar.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Oatmeal turns what you say into text and meeting notes, transcribed on your Mac.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Oatmeal turns what you say into text with Apple's on-device speech recognition when you choose Apple Speech.</string>
